:: Horse Academy Training Room
You are in the academy's multi-purpose training room. Half of the room is taken up by weight equipment and the other half is left open for aerobic exercise. 
<br><br>
<<if Time.daystate isnot "night">>
	Trainers are seen coaching their horsegirls as they lift weights or dance.
<<else>>
	The room is mostly quiet with only one or two late night trainers.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<dancestudioicon>><<link [[Practice dancing (1:00)|Horse Academy Dance]]>><<endevent>><<danceskill 5>><<pass 60>><<tiredness 5>><</link>><<ggdanceskill>><<ggtiredness>>
<br>
<<prisonicon "lift">><<link [[Take some time to lift weights (1:00)|Horse Academy Weights]]>><<endevent>><<physique 5>><<pass 60>><<tiredness 10>><</link>><<ggphysique>><<ggtiredness>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave the dorm room|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

