:: Rowan Time Spend
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<if (C.npc.Rowan.love gt 80)>>
    <<addinlineevent "ash_love1">>
        "I must apologize for the way I have been treatin' ya lately." Rowan looks geninely apologetic. "I've just been very stressed. Maybe once this whole thing is over, we can start over."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_love2">>
        "Even though ya should be trainin', I admit I like spendin' time with ya." Rowan smirks. "Though, ya better still be trainin hard for the races."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<elseif (C.npc.Rowan.love gt 40)>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove1">>
        "Look, I'll spend a little time with ya, but you should be gettin' some more trainin' done for the next race." Rowan shakes <<his>> head with a smirk but lets you sit next to <<him>>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove2">>
        "Still not too sure about ya, sugar." Rowan shakes <<his>> head. "Ya seem nice but... I need ya to put in the work to winnin' this thing."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove1">>
        "Ya wantin' to spend time with me?" Rowan looks confused. "I reckon that's okay. Just try not to be so chatty." You spend a while hanging out with Rowan.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove2">>
        "Don't you think ya should be gettin' in some more trainin'? Ya got races to win or else." Rowan looks annoyed by your lack of effort.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>
<<runeventpool>>

:: Regional Race Go
<<set $location to "horsetrack">>
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You and Rowan spend a few hours walking down the road until you arrive at the stadium. A large track surrounded by rows of bleachers sits at the center and fans already fill the seats.
<br><br>
<<if $regionalrace is 6>>
	You hear a small commotion as someone comes barging through.
	<br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Mint Mocha Introduction]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
Rowan looks worried about your chances but takes a deep breath and continues. "Well what are ya waitin' for, get in there."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Regional Race]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Mint Mocha Introduction
<<set $regionalrace to 6>>
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
<<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom to 40>>
The person barging through the croud seems to be a horsegirl with mint green hair lined with brown streaks. She looks at you with crossed arms and scoffs. "Is this the new <<girl>> who thinks <<pshe>> can beat me?" She tosses one of her twintails in confidence. "Try not to get trampled by your betters. See you on the track loser."
<br><br>
Rowan smirks at the horsegirl as she walks away and turns back toward you. "Well what are ya waitin' for, lets get ya registered."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Regional Race Register]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Regional Race Register [exitCheckBypass]
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
Rowan leads you toward the front of the stadium where a young man sits behind a booth taking tickets. Rowan takes a moment to speak to the man, before you are led back into the back of the stadium. The man speaks, "Fill out this form and once you're done we can get you placed into the race."
<br><br>
<<textbox "$inputCode" "" autofocus>>
<br>
<<button "Input Racing Name">>
<<set $playerhorsetitle to $inputCode.trim()>>
<<goto "Regional Race">>
<</button>>

