:: Horse Academy Mintro
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
As you approach, the horsegirl, Mint Mocha, looks to you with the look one would give an ugly insect. "Oh it's you again. Ignore <<pher>> girls, she's just a little annoyance."
<br><br>
The girls laugh but you don't leave. "What's wrong with you? Can't you see we have better things to do than spend time with a loser?" 
<br><br>
After a moment of silence, you still do not leave, ruining the girl's mood. One of them, a tall horsegirl with blonde hair looks over and says, "Sorry Mint, this <<girl>> is making us a little uncomfortable." The other girls head inside the academy, leaving just you and the girl they called Mint. "Ugh you ruined everything. Can't you just leave me alone?" 
<br><br>
You ignore her provocation and introduce yourself and she turns to face you annoyed. "Did you not hear me? I didn't realize you were deaf as well as stupid. Whatever." She huffs. "My name's Mint Mocha. Remember that when I beat you next race."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<set $mintmochaintro to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Horse Academy Mint Talk
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
You approach and attempt a conversation with Mint Mocha.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<if C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom gt (C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love / 2)>>
    <<addinlineevent "mintdom1">>
        "Seriously, thanks to you all of my friends find it awkward to be around." Mint looks annoyed. "You're like social napalm, freak." Despite the harsh tone, you spend some time with Mint.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "mintdom2">>
        "What part of leave me alone do you not understand? You're getting in the way of my training time." Mint huffs in frustration trying to ignore you. Despite the harsh tone, you spend some time with Mint.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<addinlineevent "mintlove1">>
        "I'll admit, there are some... upsides to knowing you." Mint blushes slightly but turns away. "That is to say, you help push me to grow stronger. Don't misunderstand." Despite the nice words, she still speaks in a harsh tone. You spend some time with Mint.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "mintlove2">>
        "Just because I respect you doesn't mean I'll go easy on you!" Mint huffs with a slight pink tone in her cheeks. "I'll still train super hard and beat you in the next race!" Despite the nice words, she still speaks in a harsh tone. You spend some time with Mint.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>
<<runeventpool>>

:: Horse Academy Closing
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
<<if $raceresult is "win">>
	As you and Rowan arrive back at the academy, you can see trainers packing bags and people saying their farewells. Rowan turns to you with a soft expression, "Well, it's seemin' like that's the end of our time together at the academy 'ere. I let ya go, if that's what ya want. But... since ya done so much for me, I would welcome ya visit to my farmstead sometime." <<He>> gives a rare shy smile as <<he>> pulls you in for a kiss. <<takeKissVirginity "Rowan" "romantic">>
	<br><br>
	<<set $ashromance to 1>>
	<<if $loveInterest.primary is "None">>
        <<set $loveInterest.primary to "Rowan">>
        <span class = "gold">Rowan is now your love interest! The thought makes you feel warm.</span>
        <br><br>
    <<else>>
        <span class = "gold">Rowan can now be claimed as your love interest! The thought makes you feel warm. <br>You can change your love interest in the "Attitudes" menu.</span>
        <br><br>
    <</if>>
	<span class="red">The academy is now closing. Collect your belongings before the entrance is closed for good tomorrow.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<set $academycloser to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	As you and Rowan arrive back at the academy, you can see trainers packing bags and people saying their farewells. Rowan turns to you with a defeated expression you're not sure you've seen from <<him>> before, "Well, I guess this is the end. Even if ya lost, I appreciate what ya tried to do. I guess that my dreamin' was just too big. My train'll be comin' soon so... I suppose this is goodbye." <<He>> hangs his head in defeat and disappears over the horizon.
	<br><br>
	<span class="red">The academy is now closing. Collect your belongings before the entrance is closed for good tomorrow.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<set $academycloser to 1>><<set $ashgone to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Passout Academy
You wake up hours later in the infirmary. It seems one of the students carried you here after you passed out. The nurse turns to you with a grim look. "You are terribly overexerted. I understand your desire to grow but... If you continue like this, you will find yourself falling apart."
<br><br>
<span class="red">You feel weaker than before.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<athletics -10>><<danceskill -10>><<physique -10>><<willpower -10>><<endevent>><</link>>

