:: Horse Academy Indoor Rowan Talk
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You approach Rowan and <<he>> raises <<his>> eyebrow confused. "So, what do you need?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Spend some time talking (0:30)|Rowan Indoor Time Spend]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 1>><<pass 30>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gte 80 or C.npc.Rowan.dom gte 40>>
	<<link [[Ask Rowan for some special love|Rowan Sex Time]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 2>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<gglove>><<gdom>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave <<him>> alone|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Indoor Time Spend
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<if (C.npc.Rowan.love gt 80)>>
    <<addinlineevent "ash_love1">>
        "I must apologize for the way I have been treatin' ya lately." Rowan looks geninely apologetic. "I've just been very stressed. Maybe once this whole thing is over, we can start over."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_love2">>
        "Even though ya should be trainin', I admit I like spendin' time with ya." Rowan smirks. "Though, ya better still be trainin hard for the races."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<elseif (C.npc.Rowan.love gt 40)>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove1">>
        "Look, I'll spend a little time with ya, but you should be gettin' some more trainin' done for the next race." Rowan shakes <<his>> head with a smirk but lets you sit next to <<him>>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_midlove2">>
        "Still not too sure about ya, sugar." Rowan shakes <<his>> head. "Ya seem nice but... I need ya to put in the work to winnin' this thing."
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<<else>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove1">>
        "Ya wantin' to spend time with me?" Rowan looks confused. "I reckon that's okay. Just try not to be so chatty." You spend a while hanging out with Rowan.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "ash_lowlove2">>
        "Don't you think ya should be gettin' in some more trainin'? Ya got races to win or else." Rowan looks annoyed by your lack of effort.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>
<<runeventpool>>